---
/** Re-fetch by convention: dispatch a bubbling CustomEvent at a region. */
---

<section class="demo">
  <h2>Re-fetch by convention</h2>
  <p>
    <code>data-on:*</code> listens for any DOM event, so re-fetching is a
    convention rather than a plugin: give a
    region <code>data-on:refetch="@get(…)"</code> and dispatch a
    bubbling <code>CustomEvent('refetch')</code> at it from anywhere.
  </p>
  <div data-on:refetch="@get('/api/time')">
    <button data-on:click="evt.target.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('refetch', {bubbles: true}))">
      Refresh now
    </button>
  </div>
</section>
